---
---
<div
  class="max-w-xl w-full bg-white text-black rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden"
>
  <div class="flex items-center p-4">
    <div
      class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-1 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-semibold"
    >
    <img src="/Logo.svg" alt="logo">
    </div>
    <div class="ml-4">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-lg">Afghan Daanish Foundation</h2>
      <p class="text-black/70 text-sm">9 oktober 2021</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-4 pb-4">
    <p>
        Vi gjorde det alle sammen!  
    </p>
    <p class="pt-4">
        Jeg er rørt til tårer, fordi jeg er så stolt over, at vi sammen kunne levere mad og forsyninger til over 200 personer i Kabul og Logar. 
        Tusinde tak til hver og en af jer, der donerede til vores nødhjælpsindsamling. Takket være jeres generøse bidrag har vi støttet forældreløse børn, 
        alenemødre, der har mistet deres mænd og ikke kan brødføde deres brøn og intern fordrevene, hvis børn ikke vil overleve sulten gennem de kommende vintermåneder.
    </p>
    <p class="pt-4">
        Vi har blandt andet leveret: 
    </p>
    <p>
        Mel (50 kg),
    </p>
    <p>
        Ris (24 kg),
    </p>
    <p>
        Olie (15 liter), 
    </p>
    <p>
        Bønner (7 kg)
    </p>
    <p>
        og Sukker (5 kg)
    </p>
 <p class="pt-4">
    - Najiba Akbari
 </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 text-black/50">
    <button class="flex items-center space-x-2 hover:text-black">
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 16 16"
        class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"
        fill="currentColor"
        height="16"
        width="16"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      >
        <path
          d="M0 0h1v15h15v1H0zm10 3.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v4a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0V4.9l-3.613 4.417a.5.5 0 0 1-.74.037L7.06 6.767l-3.656 5.027a.5.5 0 0 1-.808-.588l4-5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .758-.06l2.609 2.61L13.445 4H10.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5"
          fill-rule="evenodd"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <span>5</span>
    </button>
    <button class="flex items-center space-x-2 hover:text-black">
      <svg
        stroke="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        class="h-5 w-5"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      >
        <path
          d="M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7M12 3v18"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-linecap="round"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <span>3</span>
    </button>
    <button class="flex items-center space-x-2 hover:text-black">
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 16 16"
        class="bi bi-chat-left"
        fill="currentColor"
        height="16"
        width="16"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      >
        <path
          d="M14 1a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.414A2 2 0 0 0 3 11.586l-2 2V2a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM2 0a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12.793a.5.5 0 0 0 .854.353l2.853-2.853A1 1 0 0 1 4.414 12H14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <span>3</span>
    </button>
    <button class="flex items-center space-x-2 hover:text-primary-500">
      <svg
        stroke="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        class="h-5 w-5"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      >
        <path
          d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78-.61l-.7.7-.7-.7a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78.61c-2.19 2.36-2.12 6.14.18 8.55L12 21.35l8.22-8.19c2.3-2.41 2.37-6.19.18-8.55z"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-linecap="round"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <span>12</span>
    </button>
    <button class="flex items-center space-x-2 hover:text-black">
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 16 16"
        class="bi bi-share"
        fill="currentColor"
        height="16"
        width="16"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      >
        <path
          d="M13.5 1a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3M11 2.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 .603 1.628l-6.718 3.12a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 1.504l6.718 3.12a2.5 2.5 0 1 1-.488.876l-6.718-3.12a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0-3.256l6.718-3.12A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 11 2.5m-8.5 4a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3m11 5.5a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
